  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to be able to make it so we can choose which hand we use to move. I don't know if anybody else has this problem, but I myself am left handed and it's hard for me to play for example battle discs, because walking and throwing the disc at the same time can get a bit hard sometimes. This is totally just a quality of life change that will only matter for only a few people, but I would appreciate if it was there.",
